{
  "id": "british_imperial_system",
  "title": "British Imperial System",
  "description": "A principal system of units used in Commonwealth countries and the US. The British Imperial System is a FMLT (force-mass-length-time) system with four primary quantities, unlike the SI system which uses only three (MLT).",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## British Imperial System Overview\n\nThe British Imperial System is based on **four primary quantities**:\n- **Force (F)**: pound-force\n- **Mass (M)**: ounce, pound, slug, ton\n- **Length (L)**: inch, foot, yard, rod, chain, furlong, mile\n- **Time (T)**: second, minute, hour, day\n\nThis differs from the SI system which uses only three primary quantities (mass, length, time).\n\n## Common Conversions"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "length_feet",
          "label": "Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "feet",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "mass_pounds",
          "label": "Mass",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "pounds",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_fps",
          "label": "Velocity",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "force_lbf",
          "label": "Force",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "lbf",
          "defaultValue": 1
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "length_meters",
          "label": "Length (Metric)",
          "unit": "meters",
          "formula": "inputs.length_feet * 0.3048",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "mass_kg",
          "label": "Mass (Metric)",
          "unit": "kilograms",
          "formula": "inputs.mass_pounds * 0.453592",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_mps",
          "label": "Velocity (Metric)",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "formula": "inputs.velocity_fps * 0.3048",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "force_newtons",
          "label": "Force (Metric)",
          "unit": "newtons",
          "formula": "inputs.force_lbf * 4.448222",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "momentum",
          "label": "Momentum",
          "unit": "lb·ft/s",
          "formula": "inputs.mass_pounds * inputs.velocity_fps",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_psi",
          "label": "Pressure",
          "unit": "psi",
          "formula": "inputs.force_lbf / 1",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
